## Security Reminders

✅ **Properly Configured:**
- RLS policies prevent customers from seeing other customers' orders
- Admin functions require admin_users table entry
- Payment secrets never exposed in frontend
- Order prices calculated server-side (browser totals cannot manipulate)
- Service role key never in frontend

⚠️ **To Maintain:**
- Never expose Supabase secret keys
- Validate all customer input on backend
- Verify auth.uid() for authorization
- Keep RLS policies active
- Use HTTPS in production

